{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56408","headline":"分宜读书台诗 · 邓廷闻","name":"分宜读书台诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钟山高高钟水绿，昔有佳人在幽谷。\n台荒只见草萋萋，万卷不留谁更读。\n（见明郭子章《豫章诗话》卷二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邓廷闻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}